enlightenment is simply a choice

if you understand very simply that a choice you make results in a future experience you have 

for example, i ordered some bread rolls and ate one, which made me more sluggish than normal

which likely affected my train of thought, decisions and then led to me wanting to watch football and masturbate

now track it back, what if i order a salad and eat that instead

my thought process remains sharper i remain upright and then meditate, mind resting on how to bring about the conditions for liberation

so when truly seen 

in this moment right now

you choose nirvana or you reject it

that is what ultimately the buddha realised

he sat beneath teh bodhi tree  and chose it over everything else

but even me right now am in that same situation

i am faced with a choice do i want nibbana or do i want this other thing

anything that leads me close to nibbana vs things that lead me further away

the most powerful thing and perhaps easiest thing is the decision or vow

hence becoming a budddhist and the point of the sangha

but i think the beautiful thing is this is possible for anyone, at any moment

you choose to be enlightened

most people dont because its too much responsibility

there is a very simple thing

in each moment, how may i orient towards creating beneficial future conditions


you literally, right now are manufacturing your future experience


your current mindstream is deciding what 'moments' or events it is possible for you to have and the probability of you experiencing them

this is literally how you can see future lives and then choose the one you want

e.g. me watching el clasico highlights as a solid event or experience is likely to arise if i eat the salad

now imagine if i dont watch the highlights and instead attain realisation


just know that with each choice, you actually do get closer

but what are you getting closer to?


the complete freedom of your lover

isnt that what you want anyway?


you forget and drift, unconsciously pulled into your moments instead of ... DESIGNING them for the liberation of all beings

your choice to make the optimal next move in order to maximise the chance of enlightenment is the only thing

to have a resolve so total that the intensity itself burns away all actions that would take you away

and ultimately this is itself what reveals the deathless

the pure aspiration for it

nothing but your decision

enlightenment is simply a choice






